Description: accept the QML array syntax supported by Debian 13 Qt 6.8
Author: M1892 Mainline Project <noreply@localhost>
Origin: vendor
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-09-11

The upstream 26.02 release leaves a trailing comma after the only object in a
QML list property.  qmlcachegen from Debian 13's Qt 6.8 rejects that spelling.
Removing the trailing comma does not change the object graph or navigation
behaviour.

--- a/src/qml/KCMPageContainer.qml
+++ b/src/qml/KCMPageContainer.qml
@@ -59,7 +59,7 @@ Kirigami.Page {
                     root.actions.push(action);
                 }
             }
-        },
+        }
     ]
 
